                    <div class="topic-list">
                        <div class="topic-item"><span class="dot"></span><div><strong>SignalR real-time hubs</strong> — authenticated over a JWT handshake, not just a demo chat.</div></div>
                        <div class="topic-item"><span class="dot"></span><div><strong>Domain-driven business rules</strong> — dedicated domain services enforce privacy and depth limits.</div></div>
                        <div class="topic-item"><span class="dot"></span><div><strong>Soft-delete via global query filters</strong> — deleted data disappears everywhere, instantly, by design.</div></div>
                        <div class="topic-item"><span class="dot"></span><div><strong>Filtered SQL indexes</strong> — uniqueness enforced only on active pending requests.</div></div>
                        <div class="topic-item"><span class="dot"></span><div><strong>Policy-based rate limiting</strong> — eight partitioned windows tuned per endpoint risk.</div></div>
                        <div class="topic-item"><span class="dot"></span><div><strong>Background hosted services</strong> — hourly story cleanup, daily notification pruning.</div></div>
